Currently, Mrs. Donauly Elena Situmorang who concurrently serves as the Company's Director of Corporate Affair is serving as Corporate Secretary based on the Board of Directors' Decree No. 068/Indonet-Dir. SK/V/2021 dated May 20, 2021. Her profile can be seen on the Board of Directors' Profile.

# Training and/or Competency Development of the Corporate Secretary

Training and competency development programs attended by the Corporate Secretary can be seen on the Board of Directors' chapter.

# Implementation of Corporate Secretary's Duties in 2022

1. Organizing the Annual GMS on June 16, 2022;
2. Attending various socialization of new capital market regulations which were organized virtually by the IDX and OJK;
3. Preparing and submitting Annual Report to regulator as well as publishing the report at the Company's website;
4. Ensuring the publication of annual and quarterly financial statements are appropriate and on time based on the prevailing regulations;
5. Publishing the annual and quarterly financial performance at the Company's website;
6. Delivering information disclosure to the public in accordance with the OJK's regulations; and
7. Providing explanation and latest information concerning the Company, including its corporate actions to mass media.

# SATUAN KERJA AUDIT INTERNAL

# Internal Audit Unit

Satuan Kerja Audit Internal merupakan salah satu organ pendukung yang secara struktural berada di bawah Direktur Utama Perseroan. Satuan Kerja Audit Internal bertanggung jawab untuk membantu manajemen dalam menyusun suatu pendekatan yang sistematis serta teratur dalam rangka menjalankan fungsi pemantauan dan evaluasi atas pengelolaan risiko, pengendalian internal serta proses penerapan tata kelola perusahaan.

# Piagam Audit Internal

Dalam menjalankan tugas dan tanggung jawabnya, Unit Audit Internal berpedoman pada Piagam Audit Internal yang ditetapkan berdasarkan Surat Keputusan Direksi No. 08/Indonet-Dir.Dekom.SK/X/2020.

# Tugas dan Tanggung Jawab Unit Audit Internal

Tugas dan tanggung jawab Unit Audit Internal adalah sebagai berikut:

1. Menyusun dan melaksanakan rencana audit internal tahunan;
2. Menguji dan mengevaluasi pelaksanaan pengendalian internal dan sistem manajemen sesuai dengan kebijakan Perseroan;
3. Melakukan pemeriksaan dan penilaian atas efisiensi dan efektivitas di bidang keuangan, akuntansi, operasional, sumber daya manusia, pemasaran, teknologi informasi, dan kegiatan lainnya;

Internal Audit Unit is one of the supporting organs which is structurally under the Company's President Director. The Internal Audit Unit is responsible to assist the management in preparing a systematic approach to perform supervisory function and evaluate risk management, internal control as well as the process of corporate governance implementation.

# Internal Audit Charter

In carrying out its duties and responsibilities, the Internal Audit Unit refers to the Internal Audit Charter which was stipulated through the Board of Directors' Decree No. 08/Indonet-Dir.Dekom.SK/X/2020.

# Duties and Responsibilities of the Internal Audit Unit

The duties and responsibilities of Internal Audit Unit are:

1. Preparing and implementing the annual internal audit plan;
2. Examining and evaluating the implementation of internal control and management systems based on the Company's policies;
3. Auditing and assessing the efficiency and effectiveness of financial, accounting, operational, human resources, marketing, information technology and other activities;

